account.terms.striperunsthefraudandantimoneylaunderingchecks = { $slot-1 } runs the fraud and anti-money-laundering checks a payment company has to run; those are { $slot-2 }'s checks, not ours, and we never direct { $slot-3 } to profile you. The privacy policy names the one other use { $slot-4 }'s own terms allow ({ $slot-5 }who processes data for us{ $slot-6 }).
account.terms.theoperatedstoragekeepsrunninguntilyoursubscri = The operated storage keeps running until your subscription ends (section 3), then stops. If a renewal payment fails, the clock below doesn't start until that period has ended. If your scout access ends, you withdraw under section 3, or you stop a service early under section 9, the storage stops that day and the clock starts then; once it has stopped, your journal can't read the backup until you subscribe.
account.terms.theprivacypolicysetsouteachoftheseinfullitscit = The privacy policy sets out each of these in full: its citation, the three doors, the conditions a successor must meet, and what Article 8 means by { $slot-1 }Customer Data{ $slot-2 }, which is what these terms call your data ({ $slot-3 }what { $slot-4 } will never do{ $slot-5 }). The articles are the authority, and you can read them at { $slot-6 }{ $slot-7 }{ $slot-8 }. These covenants can't be amended without the founder's personal written consent, and after he stops serving, the language can only get stronger, never weaker, except to the minimum a law strictly requires.
